## Problem I solved
One target was unhealthy in us-east-1b. The Auto Scaling group had launched it into a public subnet with no public IP, so it couldn't download nginx. I switched the group to the private subnet and replaced the instance.

## Cleanup
Deleted the Auto Scaling group, load balancer, target group, NAT gateway, Elastic IP and VPC.
